   "label": "Ch. 8"
  },
  {
   "id": "s9",
   "label": "Ch. 9"
  },
  {
   "id": "s10",
   "label": "Ch. 10",
   "title": "“I fear we shall outsleep the coming morn"
  },
  {
   "id": "s11",
   "label": "Ch. 11",
   "title": "“Cursed be my tribe If I forgive him.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "s12",
   "label": "Ch. 12"
  },
  {
   "id": "s13",
   "label": "Ch. 13",
   "title": "“I’ll seek a readier path.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "s14",
   "label": "Ch. 14"
  },
  {
   "id": "s15",
   "label": "Ch. 15"
  },
  {
   "id": "s16",
   "label": "Ch. 16",
   "title": "“EDG.—Before you fight the battle ope this letter.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "s17",
   "label": "Ch. 17"
  },
  {
   "id": "s18",
   "label": "Ch. 18"
  },
  {
   "id": "s19",
   "label": "Ch. 19",
   "title": "“Salar.—Why, I am sure, if he forfeit, thou wilt not take his"
  },
  {
   "id": "s20",
   "label": "Ch. 20",
   "title": "“Land of Albania! let me bend mine eyes"
  },
  {
   "id": "s21",
   "label": "Ch. 21",
   "title": "“If you find a man there, he shall die a flea’s death.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "s22",
   "label": "Ch. 22"
  },
  {
   "id": "s23",
   "label": "Ch. 23",
   "title": "“But though the beast of game"
  },
  {
   "id": "s24",
   "label": "Ch. 24",
   "title": "“Thus spoke the sage: the kings without delay"
  },
  {
   "id": "s25",
   "label": "Ch. 25"
  },
  {
   "id": "s26",
   "label": "Ch. 26",
   "title": "“Bot.—Let me play the lion too.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "s27",
   "label": "Ch. 27",
   "title": "“Ant. I shall remember: When C’sar says"
  },
  {
   "id": "s28",
   "label": "Ch. 28",
   "title": "“Brief, I pray for you; for you see, ’tis a busy time with"
